<title>USA: Olathe, Kan. won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Olathe, Kan. won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds Inc., said it won $2.260 million of Olathe, Kan., certificates of participation Series 1996 B, with a net interest cost of 5.6123 percent.</p>
</text>
